BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Let's Walk!!
UID:event_315638082@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260730T032216Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260731T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260731T110000
SUMMARY:Let's Walk!! the Pompton Valley Rail Trail
DESCRIPTION:Let's Walk!!\nThere's a new multi-use paved path in Pequannock
 \, so let's check it out. Opened in 2025\, it's one of Morris County Parks
  newest and largest trail initiatives.\n\nWe'll meet at 9:30 to walk to th
 e northern terminus and back. It's about 3 miles and we'll finish in about
  75 minutes.\n\nFeeling strong and adventurous? Come at 7:00 and we'll wal
 k to the southern end and back before the others join us. This section is 
 an additional 7 miles to go out and back.\n\nBring water. Wear good shoes 
 and a hat (some sections are quite exposed). There are several street cros
 sings.\n\n[Want more info? Click HERE](https://www.morrisparks.net/parks_t
 rails/pompton-valley-rail-trail/)\n\n**Please make sure to RSVP and arrive
  5 minutes prior to start time.**\n**We start promptly at the time posted.
 **\n\n**Timeline:**\n7:00 AM - walk begins southbound from Pequannock Vall
 ey Park\n8:15 AM - return to start\n**9:30 AM - regular Meetup event begin
 s** \\- walking northbound\n10:30-11:00 AM - finish (depending on pace)\n\
 nFOLLOW US ON INSTAGRAM - letswalkmeetup\n\nDisclaimer: If you join us for
  a hike\, please understand that you are responsible for your own prepared
 ness and well-being and will hold no one else liable in case of injury or 
 mishap. Event will be canceled in the event of extreme weather.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lets-walkprogram/events/315638082/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260711T023627Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260711T023627Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Let's Walk!!
UID:event_315850250@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260730T032216Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260801T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260801T113000
SUMMARY:Let's Walk!! Orange Reservoir Loop
DESCRIPTION:Let's Walk!!\nJoin me for a loop or two around the reservoir. 
 Each loop is 1.75 miles. We will Meet at the Pavilion.\n\nThere is parking
  across the street from the Pavilion.\n\nRain or extreme weather will canc
 el the event\n\nCollaborative walk with "Montclair Women Over 50."\n\nDisc
 laimer: If you join us for a hike\, please understand that you are respons
 ible for your own preparedness and well-being and will hold no one else li
 able in case of injury or mishap.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lets-walkprogram/events/315850250/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260726T204923Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260726T204923Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Let's Walk!!
UID:event_314515743@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260730T032216Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260807T091500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260807T101500
SUMMARY:Eagle Rock Reservation
DESCRIPTION:Let's Walk!!\nJOIN US FOR A WALK. WE WALK AT A MODERATE PACE O
 N UNPAVED PATHS.\n\nWe will hike for about an hour - 3.5 miles. We will be
  walking on trails in the woods\, so appropriate footwear\, long pants & s
 ocks\, and bug spray.\n\nWill will meet at:\n[https://goo.gl/maps/7rRRTiXC
 ntdE1neD7](https://goo.gl/maps/7rRRTiXCntdE1neD7) Eagle Rock Trail Parking
  Lot by Kiosk#1\n\nIf you enter from Eagle Rock Way\, go pass the Highlawn
  and stay left. There will be a parking lot at the end of the curve to you
 r right.\n\nEagle Rock Reservation is 408 acres of hills\, streams\, and v
 alleys located on the borders of West Orange\, Verona\, and Montclair\, Ne
 w Jersey. Though located in the middle of the most densely populated count
 y in the most densely populated state in the country\, the Reservation is 
 mostly undeveloped and boasts an extensive trail system within its borders
 .\n\n**Please make sure to RSVP and arrive 5 minutes prior to start time.*
 *\n\nFOLLOW US ON INSTAGRAM - letswalkmeetup\n\nDisclaimer: If you join us
  for a hike\, please understand that you are responsible for your own prep
 aredness and well-being and will hold no one else liable in case of injury
  or mishap. Event will be canceled in the event of extreme weather.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lets-walkprogram/events/314515743/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260427T213352Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260427T213352Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Let's Walk!!
UID:event_315720833@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260730T032216Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260814T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260814T110000
SUMMARY:Let's Walk!! Brookdale Park
DESCRIPTION:Let's Walk!!\nIf entering from Bellevue Avenue and park in the
  first parking lot on the left. We will be gathering near the the playgrou
 nd area.\n\nif entering from Watchung Ave\, park and walk up to the upper 
 parking lot near the playground area.\n\nWe will be walking the outer path
 . There are several break-off points if you do not want to walk the entire
  path.\n\nThe walk will be about an hour or at least 3-4 miles.\n\nWear co
 mfortable shoes!\n\nPlease plan to arrive 5 minutes early. The walk will s
 tart promptly.\n\nBrookdale Park offers the public access to both passive 
 and active recreational activities as well as picturesque vistas. Trails f
 or walking and running\, lush groves and extensive lawns\, playgrounds\, s
 ports fields\, track facilities\, tennis courts\, an archery range and sta
 dium grandstand are just some of the numerous attractions that make Brookd
 ale Park a magnet for nature lovers\, families\, and physical fitness enth
 usiasts for miles around.\n\nhttps://www.essexcountyparks.org/parks/brookd
 ale-park\n\nDisclaimer: If you join us for a hike\, please understand that
  you are responsible for your own preparedness and well-being and will hol
 d no one else liable in case of injury or mishap.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lets-walkprogram/events/315720833/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260717T110439Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260717T110439Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
